#==============================================================================================
#
#   style_scope_2 - CSS::StyleScope: cascade layers, counter styles, :has() invalidation and
#                   tree-scoped references
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/CSS/StyleScope.cpp (lines 422-1024): the qualified layer names in
#       order, the registered counter styles (with the complex predefined ones), the :has()
#       selector insights, the pending :has() invalidations of mutated nodes, and the
#       dereferencing of global tree-scoped names through shadow roots.
